{"text": "The graph above shows the percentages of Canadians preferred reading formats. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> By age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Based on a survey conducted in 2025. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In all age groups. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Print Books were the most preferred reading format. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With the 55 64 age group showing the highest preference. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At 71%. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The percentage of people who preferred Ebooks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was the highest in the 18 29 age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Followed by the 30 44 age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> While the preference for Ebooks was higher. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Than that for Audiobooks in the 18 29 age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The opposite was true. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In both the 30 44 and 45 54 age groups. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The percentage of people who answered No Preference. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Was highest in the 30 44 age group at 11%. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Which was more than twice that of the 45 54 age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In the 55 64 age group. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The percentage of people who preferred Audiobooks. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And the percentage of people who showed No Preference. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Were both lower than that for Ebooks.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "g", "r", "a", "p", "h", " ", "a", "b", "o", "v", "e", " ", "s", "h", "o", "w", "s", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "p", "e", "r", "c", "e", "n", "t", "a", "g", "e", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "C", "a", "n", "a", "d", "i", "a", "n", "s", " ", "p", "r", "e", "f", "e", "r", "r", "e", "d", " ", "r", "e", "a", "d", "i", "n", "g", " ", "f", "o", "r", "m", "a", "t", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "y", " ", "a", "g", "e", " ", "g", "r", "o", "u", "p", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m